# A copy of Dwalin has its triggered ability (CR 707.2), and "you" is the copy's controller (CR 109.5). Bot1's Dwalin enters and
# puts a hone counter on Bot1's Paradise Mantle. Bot2's Phantasmal Image enters as a copy of Dwalin: its own "enters" trigger puts
# a hone counter on Bot2's Mantle alone, so Bot1's Mantle keeps its one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mountain
Paradise Mantle
Dwalin, Weaponmaster
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Paradise Mantle
Phantasmal Image
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Phantasmal Image.Cast
Bot2.Accept
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Subtypes = Dwarf; Illusion; Warrior
Bot2.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = 1
